From 49735f9ddfe09c4dce09aad572a75dacb81b907e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manish KL <manishklach@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 00:48:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] selftests: mm: add HBF hint ABI, migration, and
 cancellation tests
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Four test programs:

- hbf_hint_abi: validates ioctl interface — CAPS returns capabilities,
  SUBMIT accepts valid ranges and rejects invalid args, QUERY returns
  correct state, CANCEL handles unknown IDs cleanly
- hbf_promote_demote: allocates memory on a warm NUMA node, submits
  PROMOTE to the hot node, verifies 90%+ pages migrated, then DEMOTEs
  back and verifies 90%+ returned
- hbf_reject_invalid: tests error paths — zero length, overflow,
  null address, negative nid
- hbf_cancel: submits a request, queries its state, cancels it

All tests require CONFIG_HBF_CONTROL_PLANE and, for hbf_promote_demote,
at least 2 online NUMA nodes.

Signed-off-by: Manish KL <manishklach@gmail.com>
---
